{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.PhotonThreading","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse","lean:module:UGB.GrobnerShirshov.HeckeGS","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":26,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.ThreadingWitness.totalCoeffSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.ThreadingWitness.totalCoeffSum","kind":"def","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L218-L222","doc":"The witness coefficient sum. Coincides with `heckeCost` of the\naugmented braid by the GS composition lemma. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.ThreadingWitness.heckeSteps","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.ThreadingWitness.heckeSteps","kind":"def","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L216-L216","doc":"Sequence of Hecke reduction steps (witness only). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.ThreadingWitness.hadron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.ThreadingWitness.hadron","kind":"def","line":214,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L214-L214","doc":"The hadron braid word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.ThreadingWitness.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.ThreadingWitness.mk","kind":"ctor","line":212,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L212-L212","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.ThreadingWitness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.ThreadingWitness","kind":"structure","line":209,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L209-L216","doc":"A threading reduction witness: records the concrete Hecke steps\nfor a specific reduction path.  The energy is NOT computed from\nthis — it is computed from the GS normal form via `heckeCost`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.HeckeStep.coefficient","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.HeckeStep.coefficient","kind":"def","line":207,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L207-L207","doc":"Coefficient c_w at this step. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.HeckeStep.index","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.HeckeStep.index","kind":"def","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L205-L205","doc":"Generator index. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.HeckeStep.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.HeckeStep.mk","kind":"ctor","line":203,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L203-L203","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.HeckeStep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.HeckeStep","kind":"structure","line":200,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L200-L207","doc":"A Hecke reduction step: records the generator index and\ncoefficient for one application of σᵢ² → (q-q⁻¹)σᵢ + 1.\nUsed as a witness, not in the energy definition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.categoricalMass_pos_of_nontrivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.categoricalMass_pos_of_nontrivial","kind":"theorem","line":187,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L187-L196","doc":"Non-trivial braid has positive categorical mass when `q > 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.crossingEnergy_pos_of_nontrivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.crossingEnergy_pos_of_nontrivial","kind":"theorem","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L161-L185","doc":"**Key lemma**: a non-trivial braid has strictly positive crossing\nenergy when `q > 1` and the Hecke cost of its augmented braid\nis non-zero.\n\nThe Hecke cost being non-zero for a non-empty braid follows from\nthe GS basis property: the augmented braid element has a unique\nnormal form with at least one non-zero coefficient (since the\nidentity element has cost 0 and the augmented braid of a non-trivial\nknot is not the identity in H_n(q)).\n\nWe state this as a hypothesis `hcost` — the GS engine (Bokut–Shiao\naxiom) provides it for any specific braid word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.nontrivial_has_generators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.nontrivial_has_generators","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L155-L159","doc":"A non-trivial braid word has at least one generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.photon_heckeCost_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.photon_heckeCost_zero","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L147-L151","doc":"The photon (empty braid) has zero Hecke cost and hence zero mass. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.mass_eq_energy_div_cq_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.mass_eq_energy_div_cq_sq","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L136-L145","doc":"Mass equals crossing energy divided by c_q².\n`m_H = E_H / c_q²`, where `c_q = 1/(q-1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.categoricalMass_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.categoricalMass_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L129-L134","doc":"The categorical mass is non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.crossingEnergy_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.crossingEnergy_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L122-L127","doc":"The crossing energy is non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.mass_gauge_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.mass_gauge_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L108-L118","doc":"**Mass gauge invariance**: same hadron → same mass.  Same hadron\nmeans the same braid word: equal generator lists on the same\nnumber of strands (the strand count enters via the `B_{n+1}`\nphoton-augmentation embedding). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.crossing_energy_gauge_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.crossing_energy_gauge_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L88-L106","doc":"**Gauge invariance**: the crossing energy depends only on the hadron\nbraid word — concretely, on its strand count and its generator list.\nTwo braid words that agree on `nStrands` and `generators` have equal\ncrossing energy, regardless of any other (witness-only) data.\n\nThis is the genuine content of \"no reduction path to vary over\":\n`crossingEnergy` is a function of `(nStrands, generators)` alone, so\nequality of those two fields forces equality of the energy.  The\nproof rewrites along the two field equalities (the energy is *not*\n`rfl`-equal for distinct `BraidWord` records, only for ones agreeing\non the data `crossingEnergy` reads). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.categoricalMass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.categoricalMass","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L77-L84","doc":"**Categorical mass** via photon threading.\n`m_H = (q - 1)² · E_H = E_H / c_q²`\n\nLabel: `prop:photon-threading-mass` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.crossingEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.crossingEnergy","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L62-L75","doc":"**Crossing energy** of a hadron: the Hecke cost of the augmented\nbraid element in the GS framework.\n\n`E_H = heckeCost(augmentedBraidElement(β_H)) · |q - q⁻¹|`\n\nThis definition depends only on the hadron braid word — there is\nno reduction path to choose.  Gauge invariance is built in.\n\nLabel: `def:crossing-energy` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord.crossings","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord.crossings","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L57-L58","doc":"The number of crossings in a braid word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord.valid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord.valid","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L55-L55","doc":"All generators are in valid range. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord.generators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord.generators","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Sequence of generator applications (signed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord.nStrands","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord.nStrands","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Number of strands. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord.mk","kind":"ctor","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhotonThreading.BraidWord","kind":"structure","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhotonThreading.lean#L47-L55","doc":"A braid word in B_n: a list of signed generator indices.\nPositive = σᵢ, negative = σᵢ⁻¹. ","signatureChunk":0}]}